14
00:01:04,910 --> 00:01:11,045
Permissions. Who can create calls, see personal information and perform other sensitive actions.

15
00:01:11,045 --> 00:01:14,820
Review each permission; some default to every member.

16
00:01:15,420 --> 00:01:23,320
Two-Factor Authentication. Two-factor sign-in for member accounts. Enroll every administrator in two-factor sign-in.

17
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:30,922
Security and session policy. Two-factor requirements, password rules and session limits. Require two-factor

18
00:01:30,922 --> 00:01:35,770
