19
00:01:36,370 --> 00:01:41,834
Single sign-on and provisioning. Let members sign in through your identity provider, with

20
00:01:41,834 --> 00:01:47,298
optional automatic account provisioning. Know your department address and time zone, and choose

21
00:01:47,298 --> 00:01:50,660
at least two people who will administer Resgrid.

22
00:01:51,260 --> 00:01:56,350
Audit history. See who changed department settings and when. Know your department address

23
00:01:56,350 --> 00:02:01,440
and time zone, and choose at least two people who will administer Resgrid.

24
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:07,576
Account sessions and recovery. Your own sign-in sessions, password and two-factor settings. Know

25
00:02:07,576 --> 00:02:13,112
